------------------------------------------------------------
IMPORTANT -- SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE
------------------------------------------------------------

This license applies ONLY to the de-identified, derived records that are
actually distributed in this repository.

It does NOT apply to, and grants no rights over, the underlying raw content
originating from the source platforms (Weibo / Twitter and related media).
Those materials remain subject to their respective platform terms of service
and their original authors' rights. Raw platform content is NOT redistributed
here; it has been replaced by de-identified derived records (e.g., abstracted
action types, anonymized identifiers, and derived statistics).

Redistributors of the Dataset must not attempt to re-identify any individual
or re-link the records to the original platform content or accounts.

If you use the Dataset, please cite the associated paper (see README).
